    "head_commit_message": "refactor(sim): orders, the retreat, and the pursuit's and the withdrawal's records in the crate (spec 39 step 7c) (#607)\n\nOrders (orders.rs): the orders given since the last tick apply in the\norder given, who is fighting read before any lands; a retreat out of a\nfight ends its locks and withdraws from where its units stand, its\nenemies that may pursue lock on, keep their posts and take up the route\ntheir quarry flees by, and their units may break ranks. A formation\npursuing as a whole (pursuit/whole.rs) advances after its quarry, gives\nup and marches back, and takes up its post and order again. A\nwithdrawal counts its safe ticks and re-forms where its units stand or\nat home (withdraw.rs). Each squad's pursuit and withdrawal are records\nin the squad store, read by OrderRecords; FormationOrders,\nFormationPursuit and FormationWithdraw land what the crate returns in\nits order: the routes, the ragged retreat's shock, the turns and the\nevents. Their scenarios are cargo tests. Outcomes unchanged.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RQQJpuFb5KrNfB1Ar7xxDR\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>",
